      "en": "They departed from Rameses in the first month, on the fifteenth day of the first month; on the day after[NOTE:1] the Passover the Israelites went out defiantly[NOTE:2] in plain sight[NOTE:3] of all the Egyptians.",
      "notes": [
        "Heb “morrow.”",
